{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, the Monkey King has been sealed away, forgotten among ancient ruins. But now, demonic forces have awakened, threatening to consume all. Called by fate, you return \u2014 weakened, but determined. With each reincarnation, you must fight through legions, grow stronger, and try again. Between failures and revelations, you\u2019ll reclaim fragments of your former power and strive to break the cycle, sealing evil once and for all.<br><br><strong>Mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival roguelike: face relentless enemy waves with increasing difficulty.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-combat system: focus on dodging, collecting, and planning upgrades.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy mechanics: combine weapons and abilities to unlock unique effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression: unlock upgrades and new forms after each run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reincarnation &amp; narrative: die and return stronger, uncovering the Monkey King's story.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083010?t=1763157350","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083010?t=1763157350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083010/ddbffb12b0af4a79ef97b03f40a9a228a92da4d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763157350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083010/ddbffb12b0af4a79ef97b03f40a9a228a92da4d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763157350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full"